  "loc": "Abstract, p.1; Section 2, p.3",
  "quote": "people select from a set of non-rival alternatives",
  "note": "The paper axiomatically characterises a singularity ordering of alternatives within a choice profile and a diversity (Herfindahl-Hirschman) ranking of choice profiles, as a measure of ex-post freedom of choice. Individuals choose non-rival alternatives for themselves, and no inputs are aggregated into a collective decision. Elections are mentioned only as an illustration. Coding stopped."
